<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 168 0 R/T(Children and young people \(CYP\) spend an average of 32.5 hours per week in school, making these environments critical to their health and educational outcomes. Improving school environments presents a unique opportunity to promote health and equity for all children.)/E(Children and young people \(CYP\) spend an average of 32.5 hours per week in school, making these environments critical to their health and educational outcomes. Improving school environments presents a unique opportunity to promote health and equity for all children.)/Pg 54 0 R/K[0]>>
