629 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 168 0 R/T(The Child And Adolescent Health Impacts Of Learning Indoor Environments Under Net Zero: \(CHILI\) Hub aims to advance understanding of how school building environments affect CYP\220s health by combining detailed school building data with national health and education records.)/E(The Child And Adolescent Health Impacts Of Learning Indoor Environments Under Net Zero: \(CHILI\) Hub aims to advance understanding of how school building environments affect CYP\220s health by combining detailed school building data with national health and education records.)/Pg 54 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

630 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 168 0 R/T(In this presentation, we will outline our approach, which leverages the Modelling Platform for Schools \(MPS\) to generate and validate thermal and air quality models of school buildings. MPS integrates data from sources such as the Ordnance Survey \(OS\), Condition Data Collection \(CDC\), SAMHE indoor air quality data and Display Energy Certificates \(DEC\). These school buildings data will be linked to national, individual-level, administrative data on children\220s health and education, including ECHILD, Kids\220 Environment and Health Cohort \(England\) and the SAIL Databank \(Wales\).)/E(In this presentation, we will outline our approach, which leverages the Modelling Platform for Schools \(MPS\) to generate and validate thermal and air quality models of school buildings. MPS integrates data from sources such as the Ordnance Survey \(OS\), Condition Data Collection \(CDC\), SAMHE indoor air quality data and Display Energy Certificates \(DEC\). These school buildings data will be linked to national, individual-level, administrative data on children\220s health and education, including ECHILD, Kids\220 Environment and Health Cohort \(England\) and the SAIL Databank \(Wales\).)/Pg 54 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

631 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 168 0 R/T(Further we will explore the impact of High Efficiency Particulate Air \(HEPA\) filter installation and use in primary school on children\220s health and education outcomes. This analysis will link data on use and functioning of HEPA filters the HEPA-ACT trial with primary and secondary care records and education data via the Connected Bradford regional administrative data resource.)/E(Further we will explore the impact of High Efficiency Particulate Air \(HEPA\) filter installation and use in primary school on children\220s health and education outcomes. This analysis will link data on use and functioning of HEPA filters the HEPA-ACT trial with primary and secondary care records and education data via the Connected Bradford regional administrative data resource.)/Pg 54 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

632 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 168 0 R/T(We will present our proposed methodology, outcomes and expected challenges, emphasizing how linking multiple datasets allows for a comprehensive analysis of school environments, pupil demographics, and health indicators while accounting for geographical and socioeconomic variations. Our findings will inform policies and interventions to create healthier, more equitable learning spaces for all children.)/E(We will present our proposed methodology, outcomes and expected challenges, emphasizing how linking multiple datasets allows for a comprehensive analysis of school environments, pupil demographics, and health indicators while accounting for geographical and socioeconomic variations. Our findings will inform policies and interventions to create healthier, more equitable learning spaces for all children.)/Pg 54 0 R/K[4 5]>>
endobj

