<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 172 0 R/E(The Healthy Buildings Network Leeds \(HBN\) is a Horizons Challenge Network from  the University of Leeds founded in 2024. It is a pioneering initiative that brings together diverse expertise to transform our built environment into a catalyst for health, well-being, and sustainability. )/Pg 59 0 R/K[3 4]>>
endobj

663 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 172 0 R/E(We strive to create a world where every building supports human health and environmental sustainability, regardless of geographic or economic context. Our motivation is to foster innovative, interdisciplinary research and practical solutions that enhance indoor environments globally. )/Pg 59 0 R/K[5 6]>>
endobj

